<description>&lt;p&gt;Ecuador is enforcing a fourth curfew through Nov. 10 in five coastal provinces as violence escalates, and the military has begun its first land operation against cartels with U.S. assistance, including U.S. Marines seizing a vessel linked to the Los Choneros gang in the eastern Pacific. Heavy rain on Santa Cruz Island in the Galapagos killed one person, left two missing, and a priest was killed when a crucifix fell on him, prompting an archbishop to announce a clergy safety plan. President Daniel Noboa continues to detain opposition leader Luisa González on money-laundering charges. The crisis recorded two battle-related deaths in 2019, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxOdjBOQXZQc29mZ3RtUzlIUFRGbkt5Y3FLVU4yMlVvZjIxX3NSNG50MmxyOENhVEN0TF8zWmxJTFRYU0QzMFVvWlllcmVELUprZkwySUwyLS16RGo3Y3hFMmo0MFI5ZDI5WUhYQS1sY3lEcVVHbG9hRjAtaTc1dVVMUG1CMU1ha3I3U2Z3?oc=5&quot;&gt;thetraveler.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxQZE9qX0RFcnBWeE95RnpybGczUDlfZVVybFlCbGozWUlkY3MyN3Brb1FWTDZLdHZnRkFCbXJCM0x4dW51S3ctUVNPQU1rVlNJSnhVamNCQjFROXBqMUNHTEtVZ2p4SDFDWjE0R1Boakhqc19xR2t5VmlNVUlkc0x3LVpDdUxISkJQYTRsUkZzaWd2NU50YXYyc2tfVVhkRldwMWVyVw?oc=5&quot;&gt;WBUR&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxPLS1Jc3BTYTFYWm1mRElNMXJXUnBKNEs4U2dCVURobkM5LXNTbWdkZDdEMk5YakFIY1d3UkhCNDU4YzFXN0VfT3BKcVlkNjA0WFlLT0dOcWxTTlZrcGlUa0s4MHBIbGhQSEt1R1o2Z2ZUQm9mczc2Z3NrWThxdGtObEl3c3hmajA1WC0xQ3RR?oc=5&quot;&gt;thetraveler.org&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijwFBVV95cUxON1ZtUkltYmh2OC1Qc2EyVmRQVDN2NS1rZEZrdHZFSHNLS3BhMGIwemRRMlpvcmJiRGVaQWdSR3VDSURmaUNuSFRqUUtjNGFFNElMdzFkOGFuUDBnSE9JRlpIUGFfMm9KMkM4eUh1SDBVQXVkQ3VfbjVSMFhLajhGTFdzbURtN0VwOXgxLVR1SQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;thetraveler.org